6. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)
Q1. What is a RAG AI chatbot?

A RAG chatbot retrieves relevant information from your documents and uses that context to generate answers. It helps users find information without manually searching through entire PDFs.

Q2. Can you build a chatbot that answers only from my documents?

Yes. I can configure the retrieval pipeline and prompts to prioritize your documents, provide source references where supported, and indicate when relevant information cannot be found. No RAG system can guarantee that every generated answer will be error-free.

Q3. Can the chatbot work without paid AI APIs?

Yes. I can configure supported local language models through Ollama. Your computer or server must have sufficient resources to run the selected models.

Q4. Can you process scanned PDFs?

Yes. I can integrate OCR using Tesseract to extract text from scanned documents. Results depend on document quality, language data, and formatting.

Q5. Can you support Bengali and English?

Yes. I can configure bilingual question answering and document processing for Bengali and English, subject to the selected models and OCR accuracy.

Q6. Can I upload more PDFs later?

Yes. I can implement incremental document ingestion so new files can be indexed without rebuilding the entire knowledge base, where supported by the architecture.

Q7. Can you integrate this chatbot into my existing website?

Yes. I can integrate the assistant into an existing website or build a standalone web application. Please contact me to discuss your current technology stack.

Q8. Do you provide deployment and installation?

Installation and setup are included according to the selected package. Cloud deployment, server configuration, domain setup, and other infrastructure work should be agreed upon before ordering.


